and enforcing for weeks; the record should carry the irony plainly — the
first real red it caught was W-022's own module-load red at round 2, and
L-021 names `opus.red_content` as what addresses the very class
(review×evidence-backfilled-or-absent) whose 4th recurrence W-022 was.

